sequenceDiagram
    participant Learner
    participant Teacher
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant DB
    participant LiveKit
    participant Notifications

    Note over Learner,Notifications: Session Request Flow
    
    Learner->>Frontend: Browse peers
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/browse?tab=peers
    Backend->>DB: Query peers with filters
    DB-->>Backend: Peers list
    Backend-->>Frontend: Peers data
    Frontend-->>Learner: Display peers
    
    Learner->>Frontend: Click "Request Session" on peer
    Frontend->>Frontend: Navigate to /request-session/[userId]
    Learner->>Frontend: Fill session request form<br/>(title, date, duration, skills)
    Learner->>Frontend: Submit form
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/peer-sessions<br/>(with JWT token)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token
    Backend->>DB: Check learner's coin balance
    DB-->>Backend: Balance sufficient
    Backend->>DB: Create PeerSession<br/>(status: PENDING)
    Backend->>DB: Create Payment<br/>(status: ESCROW)
    Backend->>DB: Deduct coins from learner
    DB-->>Backend: Session and payment created
    Backend->>DB: Create Notification<br/>(for teacher)
    DB-->>Backend: Notification created
    Backend->>Notifications: Send push notification<br/>(if subscribed)
    Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Created (session data)
    Frontend-->>Learner: Success notification<br/>Redirect to dashboard
    
    Note over Learner,Notifications: Session Acceptance Flow
    
    Teacher->>Frontend: View dashboard
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/dashboard<br/>(with JWT token)
    Backend->>DB: Get pending requests
    DB-->>Backend: Pending sessions
    Backend-->>Frontend: Dashboard data
    Frontend-->>Teacher: Display pending request
    
    Teacher->>Frontend: Click "Accept" on session request
    Frontend->>Backend: PATCH /api/peer-sessions/:id/status<br/>(status: UPCOMING)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token
    Backend->>DB: Update session status to UPCOMING
    Backend->>DB: Confirm payment (ESCROW confirmed)
    DB-->>Backend: Session updated
    Backend->>DB: Create Notification<br/>(for learner: session accepted)
    DB-->>Backend: Notification created
    Backend->>Notifications: Send push notification
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK (updated session)
    Frontend-->>Teacher: Success notification
    
    Note over Learner,Notifications: Session Reminder Flow
    
    Backend->>Backend: Scheduled job: Check upcoming sessions<br/>(24h, 1h, 5m before)
    Backend->>DB: Query sessions starting soon
    DB-->>Backend: Upcoming sessions list
    Backend->>DB: Create Notifications<br/>(for both participants)
    Backend->>Notifications: Send push notifications<br/>(24h, 1h, 5m reminders)
    
    Note over Learner,Notifications: Join Live Session Flow
    
    Learner->>Frontend: View session details page
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/peer-sessions/:id<br/>(with JWT token)
    Backend->>DB: Get session details
    DB-->>Backend: Session data
    Backend-->>Frontend: Session data
    Frontend-->>Learner: Display session details
    
    Learner->>Frontend: Click "Join Session"<br/>(at session time)
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/livekit/token<br/>(room name, user permissions)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token
    Backend->>LiveKit: Generate access token
    LiveKit-->>Backend: LiveKit token
    Backend-->>Frontend: LiveKit token
    Frontend->>LiveKit: Initialize LiveKit client<br/>with token
    Frontend->>Frontend: Request camera/mic permissions
    Learner->>Frontend: Grant permissions
    Frontend->>LiveKit: Join room
    LiveKit-->>Frontend: Connected to room
    
    Teacher->>Frontend: Click "Join Session"
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/livekit/token
    Backend->>LiveKit: Generate access token
    LiveKit-->>Backend: LiveKit token
    Backend-->>Frontend: LiveKit token
    Frontend->>LiveKit: Join room
    LiveKit-->>Frontend: Connected to room
    LiveKit-->>Learner: Teacher joined notification
    LiveKit-->>Teacher: Learner joined notification
    
    Note over Learner,Notifications: Session Completion Flow
    
    Learner->>Frontend: Click "Mark as Complete"<br/>(after session)
    Frontend->>Backend: PATCH /api/peer-sessions/:id/status<br/>(status: DONE)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token
    Backend->>DB: Update session status to DONE
    Backend->>DB: Update Payment<br/>(status: RECEIVED)
    Backend->>DB: Transfer coins to teacher
    DB-->>Backend: Payment released
    Backend->>DB: Create Notifications<br/>(review reminders for both)
    Backend->>Notifications: Send push notifications
    Backend-->>Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend-->>Learner: Success notification
    
    Note over Learner,Notifications: Review Submission Flow
    
    Learner->>Frontend: Click "Submit Review"
    Frontend->>Frontend: Navigate to /submit-review/[sessionId]
    Learner->>Frontend: Fill review form<br/>(rating: 5, review text)
    Learner->>Frontend: Submit review
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/reviews<br/>(rating, review, revieweeId, sessionId)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify JWT token
    Backend->>DB: Check if already reviewed
    DB-->>Backend: Not reviewed yet
    Backend->>DB: Create Review
    Backend->>DB: Calculate average rating<br/>for reviewee
    Backend->>DB: Update reviewee's metrics
    DB-->>Backend: Review created, rating updated
    Backend->>DB: Create Notification<br/>(for reviewee: new review)
    Backend->>Notifications: Send push notification
    Backend-->>Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend-->>Learner: Success notification<br/>Redirect to dashboard

